# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:2
translate italian u20d_57a32b89:

    # "For now, I should go see Jamie."
    "Per ora, dovrei andare a trovare Jamie."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:5
translate italian u20d_09cc067a:

    # "I drive home, then walk over to Jamie's house, and ring the doorbell."
    "Guido fino a casa, poi vado a piedi a casa di Jamie e suono il campanello."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:6
translate italian u20d_5240dedf:

    # "It's late and I hate to wake them, but I need to see her."
    "È tardi e non vorrei svegliarli, ma ho bisogno di vederla."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:9
translate italian u20d_65a45c72:

    # jd "[pcname]?"
    jd "[pcname]?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:10
translate italian u20d_4297141b:

    # jd "What the hell happened to you, son?"
    jd "Che diavolo ti è successo, figliolo?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:11
translate italian u20d_606da365:

    # jd "I thought you took off again. Jamie's been upset for weeks."
    jd "Pensavo che te ne fossi andato di nuovo. Jamie è sconvolta da settimane."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:12
translate italian u20d_61c5bb7a:

    # pc "I'm sorry. I didn't mean to leave for so long. I've been trying to get back."
    pc "Mi dispiace. Non volevo stare via così a lungo. Stavo cercando di tornare."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:15
translate italian u20d_ad0c6ecb:

    # jd "She's going to be happy to see you."
    jd "Sarà felice di vederti."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:16
translate italian u20d_a1205e82:

    # jd "Why don't you just go up and see her?"
    jd "Perché non sali a trovarla?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:17
translate italian u20d_02b70148:

    # pc "Thanks, Rich."
    pc "Grazie, Rich."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:18
translate italian u20d_f246a5a7:

    # jd "Nice beard by the way."
    jd "A proposito, bella barba."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:22
translate italian u20d_e2bc298b:

    # "I walk quietly up the stairs and into Jamie's room. She's in bed, sleeping."
    "Salgo silenziosamente le scale ed entro nella stanza di Jamie. È a letto, che dorme."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:25
translate italian u20d_a95bfc0c:

    # "Trying not to wake her immediately, I lie next to her and wrap her in my arms."
    "Cercando di non svegliarla subito, mi sdraio accanto a lei e la stringo tra le braccia."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:28
translate italian u20d_c981bd85:

    # "She jolts awake and looks at me, shocked."
    "Si sveglia di soprassalto e mi guarda, scioccata."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:29
translate italian u20d_95496a48:

    # gnd "[pcname]? Is it really you?"
    gnd "[pcname]? Sei davvero tu?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:32
translate italian u20d_0f0952fe:

    # "I don't answer. I just pull her close and kiss her deeply."
    "Non rispondo. La stringo solo a me e la bacio appassionatamente."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:33
translate italian u20d_3375c7eb:

    # gnd "I thought I lost you! I've been so worried."
    gnd "Pensavo di averti perso! Ero così preoccupata."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:36
translate italian u20d_de1105f0:

    # gnd "So all of that stuff was true? You really saw your dad?"
    gnd "Quindi era tutto vero? Hai davvero visto tuo padre?"

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:37
translate italian u20d_2a9e9f2b:

    # pc "Yeah, I did. It's all true. I'll tell you about it tomorrow."
    pc "Sì, l’ho visto. È tutto vero. Te ne parlerò domani."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:40
translate italian u20d_34ae9f69:

    # gnd "I'm just glad you're back."
    gnd "Sono solo felice che tu sia tornata."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:41
translate italian u20d_25f299a8:

    # gnd "That hair looks awful though."
    gnd "Quei capelli sono un disastro, però."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:44
translate italian u20d_f432b969:

    # "I pull her close and kiss her again, feeling her warmth."
    "La stringo a me e la bacio di nuovo, sentendo il suo calore."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:45
translate italian u20d_137d3396:

    # gnd "I missed you so much, [pcname]."
    gnd "Mi sei mancata tantissimo, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Update20/u20d.rpy:46
translate italian u20d_12a0fbc0:

    # pc "I missed you too, Jamie."
    pc "Anche tu mi sei mancata, Jamie."

